<title>USA: West Marine Jan same-store sales up 9.4 pct.</title>
<headline>West Marine Jan same-store sales up 9.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Marine Inc Thursday said net sales in January rose 47.5 percent to $17.0 million from $11.5 million a year ago while same-store sales for the four-week period ended January 25 rose 9.4 percent.</p>
<p>The comparable store sales information refers only to West Marine stores. West Marine is the nation's largest specialty retailer of recreational and commercial boating supplies and apparel.</p>
</text>
